            "detailed_description": "<h1>Oferta exclusiva do Steam</h1><p><strong>ATTENTION:</strong><br>Steam version of the game has several significant differences from the freeware version. In this version of the game was made a lot of fixes, added some new extra levels and a lot of new gameplay features. By purchasing this version of the game, you will support the developer and it is allow us in the future to release new interesting projects!</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Your task is to put things at their places inside a complex computer system. It’s a whole world with its own laws and filled by mono-drones, which you will control. Use them to place tetra-blocks at its places.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> There are up to 8 different types of mono-drones with individual features (explode, swap, infect, time-control and more)<br></li><li> Hidden rules of game world, which you have to explore for progression<br></li><li> Non-linear. You always have few levels to try. If you can't solve one, then try another!<br></li><li> More than 100 levels which were built with care for you to learn all the rules step by step.</li></ul><br>Reach System Core and discover how this techno world was born!",
            "about_the_game": "Your task is to put things at their places inside a complex computer system. It’s a whole world with its own laws and filled by mono-drones, which you will control. Use them to place tetra-blocks at its places.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> There are up to 8 different types of mono-drones with individual features (explode, swap, infect, time-control and more)<br></li><li> Hidden rules of game world, which you have to explore for progression<br></li><li> Non-linear. You always have few levels to try. If you can't solve one, then try another!<br></li><li> More than 100 levels which were built with care for you to learn all the rules step by step.</li></ul><br>Reach System Core and discover how this techno world was born!",
            "short_description": "Push and rotate blocks, placing them at their places. Discover mono-drones abilities, step by step learn rules of that somber techno world. Solve more than 100 amazing puzzles!",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês, Russo",
